                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Peking,
                                China</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-01-25"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 25, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1484.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose translation of
                    the note this date received from Prince Ch’ing, and to be, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger.</hi></signed></closer>




